WEBVTT

00:00.555 --> 00:07.018
I'm in a courtroom, cold and grey. She's on the

00:07.098 --> 00:13.341
left side, across the way. A lawyer spinning

00:13.401 --> 00:16.263
twisted lies about the boy, he's

00:16.403 --> 00:20.285
incapacitated. A captive who's been

00:20.305 --> 00:27.779
manipulated. But then, the night... Shark

00:27.879 --> 00:32.042
begins to rise. She stands and speaks her voice

00:32.062 --> 00:35.584
clear. Your honor, there's no captive here.

00:35.785 --> 00:41.696
He's a competent adult with a 4.0 result. Deans,

00:41.956 --> 00:46.180
a transcript in her hand Self-elocusy, he took a

00:46.220 --> 00:49.403
stand A wall of facts, a wall of proof It's

00:49.443 --> 00:53.347
tearing off her broken roof And in the back, my

00:53.687 --> 00:57.831
family Sixteen strong, all here for me This

00:58.031 --> 01:03.757
isn't a fight, it's a release She has no case

01:06.686 --> 01:10.288
The judge's eyes, they turn to me. Son, do you

01:10.388 --> 01:14.010
feel you are not free? I look at her, my voice is

01:14.030 --> 01:17.232
strong. I'm safer than I've ever been. This is

01:17.272 --> 01:23.936
the only family that I have ever known or seen.

01:23.976 --> 01:28.138
Transcript in her hand. Self-advocacy, he took

01:28.298 --> 01:31.600
a stand. A wall of facts, a wall of proof. It's

01:31.660 --> 01:35.582
tearing off a broken roof. And in the back, This

01:35.602 --> 01:40.665
is not a case of incapacity. This is apparent.

02:04.322 --> 02:05.222
who can't let go.

02:08.584 --> 02:10.965
This petition is a waste of this court's time.

02:12.866 --> 02:15.367
You are dangerously close to legal harassment.

02:16.307 --> 02:20.048
Dismissed. With prejudice!

02:36.707 --> 02:40.868
A transcript in her hand Saw the look, I see he

02:40.908 --> 02:44.749
took a stand A wall of facts, a wall of proof It's

02:44.769 --> 02:48.750
tearing up a broken roof And in the back, my

02:48.990 --> 02:53.131
family Sixteen strong, all here for me This

02:53.331 --> 03:02.293
isn't a fight, it's a release She has no case

03:02.693 --> 03:04.734
She has no case

03:09.398 --> 03:14.862
Dismissed

03:15.083 --> 03:19.206
Dismissed

03:19.586 --> 03:21.428
With prejudice

